1
00:01:42,009 --> 00:01:48,990
[Genius Girlfriend]

2
00:01:49,490 --> 00:01:51,950
[Episode 15]

3
00:01:53,780 --> 00:01:57,720
[Class Meeting]

4
00:01:54,120 --> 00:01:55,590
The winter break is from January 20th

5
00:01:55,590 --> 00:01:56,590
to February 28th,

6
00:01:56,590 --> 00:01:57,479
40 days in total.

7
00:01:57,479 --> 00:01:59,070
Every teacher has assigned homework.

8
00:01:57,810 --> 00:02:00,120
[Pursue Knowledge, Seek Truth;
Practice Diligently, Foster Innovation]

9
00:01:59,070 --> 00:01:59,950
Write it down.

10
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:02,420
For math, 1 workbook
and 10 mock papers.

11
00:02:02,710 --> 00:02:03,590
Oh my gosh.

12
00:02:03,590 --> 00:02:05,120
For Chinese, 10 essays,

13
00:02:04,360 --> 00:02:06,160
[Class Meeting]

14
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:06,430
10 classical Chinese texts
you must memorize,

15
00:02:06,430 --> 00:02:07,510
and reading notes.

16
00:02:07,590 --> 00:02:08,400
For English,

17
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:10,750
memorize all the vocabulary lists
for the next semester.

18
00:02:10,750 --> 00:02:11,680
And for science...

19
00:02:11,510 --> 00:02:12,900
[Pursue Knowledge, Seek Truth;
Practice Diligently, Foster Innovation]

20
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:15,310
Let me remind you,

21
00:02:15,430 --> 00:02:16,590
even though you're only in grade 10,

22
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:18,720
[Constantly Strive to Become Stronger;
Strive to Be Number One]

23
00:02:16,590 --> 00:02:18,590
high school life goes by in a flash.

24
00:02:18,960 --> 00:02:20,560
Even though we are
in the experimental class,

25
00:02:20,560 --> 00:02:22,079
if you let your guard down
even a little bit,

26
00:02:22,079 --> 00:02:23,680
you'll be the one left behind.

27
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:24,630
So, class,

28
00:02:24,630 --> 00:02:26,150
cherish this winter break.

29
00:02:26,150 --> 00:02:27,430
Because when you come back
for the new semester,

30
00:02:27,430 --> 00:02:28,750
you will never have

31
00:02:28,750 --> 00:02:30,400
such relaxing days again.

32
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:31,710
Alright, that's all I have to say.

33
00:02:31,710 --> 00:02:33,040
Be safe on your way home.

34
00:02:33,050 --> 00:02:34,490
[Constantly Strive to Become Stronger;
Strive to Be Number One]

35
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:34,710
Happy New Year in advance.

36
00:02:51,430 --> 00:02:52,490
What are your plans

37
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:54,090
for the winter break, guys?

38
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:56,440
I have no plans. I'm on break.

39
00:02:57,590 --> 00:02:59,050
But the lab isn't on break,

40
00:02:59,150 --> 00:03:00,880
so there's still no one at home.

41
00:03:01,840 --> 00:03:04,520
I'm traveling abroad
with my parents this year.

42
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:07,960
That's nice.

43
00:03:11,150 --> 00:03:13,750
I'll stay home, read books,
and watch the shop.

44
00:03:14,190 --> 00:03:15,870
That's a bit boring.

45
00:03:16,150 --> 00:03:17,350
What about you, Tang?

46
00:03:18,310 --> 00:03:19,120
Tang?

47
00:03:22,190 --> 00:03:23,000
Tang?

48
00:03:24,190 --> 00:03:25,800
What are you doing for winter break?

49
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:27,150
I don't have any plans.

50
00:03:34,150 --> 00:03:35,240
I have an idea.

51
00:03:36,079 --> 00:03:37,710
Since we have so much
winter break homework,

52
00:03:37,710 --> 00:03:40,590
why don't we get the hard part
out of the way first?

53
00:03:41,190 --> 00:03:42,630
Let's spend 5 days

54
00:03:42,750 --> 00:03:44,470
working together

55
00:03:44,560 --> 00:03:45,520
to finish all the homework

56
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:47,590
within these 5 days.

57
00:03:48,190 --> 00:03:49,960
For the rest of the break,
we can just relax

58
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:51,190
and have a great time.

59
00:03:51,430 --> 00:03:52,430
Wouldn't that be exciting?

60
00:03:52,430 --> 00:03:53,800
Wouldn't that be awesome?

61
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:55,260
What do you say? Are you in?

62
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:03,280
Zhixia.

63
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:05,560
Are you in?

64
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:12,520
Sure.

65
00:04:14,150 --> 00:04:16,149
What about you guys? Say something.

66
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:17,560
I'm in.

67
00:04:18,040 --> 00:04:18,720
Sure.

68
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:24,920
I won't join you.

69
00:04:25,310 --> 00:04:26,560
I've already planned

70
00:04:26,560 --> 00:04:28,510
my daily study schedule
based on the holidays.

71
00:04:28,510 --> 00:04:30,630
If I finish all my homework today,

72
00:04:31,120 --> 00:04:32,000
I don't know what other tutoring classes

73
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:33,659
my parents will sign me up for.

74
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:36,360
I understand.

75
00:04:36,830 --> 00:04:38,090
I totally understand.

76
00:04:40,390 --> 00:04:41,190
Tang,

77
00:04:41,360 --> 00:04:42,360
you can just tag along and benefit.

78
00:04:42,360 --> 00:04:43,480
You definitely have to join.

79
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:45,190
If you have any questions you don't know,

80
00:04:45,190 --> 00:04:47,480
all these experts will help you out.

81
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:48,720
It'll be great.

82
00:04:50,240 --> 00:04:52,570
Let's just treat it as studying together.

83
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:55,630
Okay, then it's settled.

84
00:06:05,190 --> 00:06:05,830
Tang.

85
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:07,840
What's wrong?

86
00:06:18,600 --> 00:06:20,260
I really can't write anymore.

87
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:21,560
I'm going home first.

88
00:06:22,390 --> 00:06:23,390
You guys go ahead.

89
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:43,520
What's wrong with Tingting?

90
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:48,760
She didn't do well on the exam this time.

91
00:06:50,159 --> 00:06:51,120
Doesn't our school

92
00:06:51,120 --> 00:06:52,720
require you to change classes
if the sum of your 2 total scores

93
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:54,800
drops out of the top 50 in the grade?

94
00:06:55,190 --> 00:06:57,510
She ranked 49th
in the grade the first time,

95
00:06:57,510 --> 00:06:58,830
and 53rd this time.

96
00:06:58,830 --> 00:07:00,190
So she is at great risk.

97
00:07:01,920 --> 00:07:02,560
Well,

98
00:07:02,870 --> 00:07:05,000
the final ranking of the 2 total scores

99
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:06,430
also depends on other students.

100
00:07:06,430 --> 00:07:08,680
You can't just compare her scores alone.

101
00:07:08,680 --> 00:07:09,720
So,

102
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:11,680
Tang Tingting's fate

103
00:07:11,680 --> 00:07:13,510
is no longer in her own hands.

104
00:07:13,510 --> 00:07:14,970
How can she not be anxious?

105
00:07:19,480 --> 00:07:20,360
If you ask me,

106
00:07:20,950 --> 00:07:22,550
there is only one way out now.

107
00:07:25,870 --> 00:07:27,360
God, have mercy.

108
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:30,740
Let's not mention this

109
00:07:30,870 --> 00:07:32,070
in front of her.

110
00:07:46,870 --> 00:07:48,240
I'm back, Mom.

111
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:50,560
Zhixia, you're back.

112
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:52,050
My daughter is back.

113
00:07:53,120 --> 00:07:54,070
Zhixia, come here.

114
00:07:54,070 --> 00:07:55,390
Look who are here.

115
00:07:57,430 --> 00:07:59,030
Your uncle and aunt are here.

116
00:07:59,159 --> 00:08:00,390
Hello, Uncle. Hello, Aunt.

117
00:08:00,390 --> 00:08:01,240
Hello.

118
00:08:02,240 --> 00:08:03,040
Have a seat.

119
00:08:06,310 --> 00:08:07,000
Zhixia,

120
00:08:07,600 --> 00:08:09,070
we haven't seen each other for years.

121
00:08:09,070 --> 00:08:10,600
She's getting prettier.

122
00:08:11,830 --> 00:08:13,480
Have your studies
been tiring you out lately?

123
00:08:13,480 --> 00:08:14,240
Not really.

124
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:17,920
Zhuangzhuang, don't you recognize
your sister Zhixia?

125
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:20,850
You two used to play together
a lot when you were kids.

126
00:08:23,510 --> 00:08:24,270
Zhixia.

127
00:08:24,420 --> 00:08:27,680
Your uncle said you've loved snacks
since you were little.

128
00:08:27,680 --> 00:08:29,390
Here, take this bag of snacks
back to your room

129
00:08:29,390 --> 00:08:30,430
and share them with your brother.

130
00:08:30,430 --> 00:08:31,360
Oh, you.

131
00:08:31,380 --> 00:08:33,789
We have all kinds of snacks
in our supermarket.

132
00:08:33,789 --> 00:08:35,169
Why are you being so polite?

133
00:08:35,169 --> 00:08:37,289
We have them in the store. Really.

134
00:08:37,549 --> 00:08:38,240
Sister,

135
00:08:38,549 --> 00:08:39,960
how is the business at your supermarket?

136
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:41,020
Is it making money?

137
00:08:41,059 --> 00:08:43,480
Not bad. It's enough to get by.

138
00:08:44,550 --> 00:08:45,440
If you ask me,

139
00:08:45,440 --> 00:08:47,200
relying entirely
on a supermarket for a living

140
00:08:47,200 --> 00:08:48,800
is not a long-term solution.

141
00:08:49,130 --> 00:08:51,600
You just haven't reached
the point where you need money.

142
00:08:51,600 --> 00:08:52,720
Think about it.

143
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:55,240
These two kids
will be going to college soon.

144
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:57,390
After they graduate,
they'll need to find jobs

145
00:08:57,390 --> 00:08:58,450
and find a partner.

146
00:08:58,510 --> 00:09:00,030
And Zeqiu is a boy.

147
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:02,360
You'll have plenty of expenses
in the future.

148
00:09:02,360 --> 00:09:03,710
Exactly.

149
00:09:03,730 --> 00:09:05,840
Everything costs money nowadays.

150
00:09:07,120 --> 00:09:08,320
Our generation

151
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:09,840
is destined to work hard.

152
00:09:10,270 --> 00:09:12,440
We work so hard to earn this money,

153
00:09:12,960 --> 00:09:15,360
isn't it all just to provide
for our family?

154
00:09:15,720 --> 00:09:16,320
Yes.

155
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:19,320
Just a few days ago,
we went back to our parents' house.

156
00:09:19,790 --> 00:09:20,870
That house

157
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:23,000
is really unlivable now.

158
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:24,060
The roof leaks,

159
00:09:24,200 --> 00:09:25,080
and it smells.

160
00:09:26,270 --> 00:09:27,600
We immediately decided

161
00:09:27,960 --> 00:09:28,820
to renovate it.

162
00:09:32,670 --> 00:09:34,910
Then let's make it clear.

163
00:09:34,930 --> 00:09:36,480
However much the renovation costs,

164
00:09:36,480 --> 00:09:37,870
make a list later,

165
00:09:37,870 --> 00:09:38,840
we'll calculate it

166
00:09:38,840 --> 00:09:40,030
and split it half-half.

167
00:09:40,030 --> 00:09:41,830
Sis, why are you telling me this?

168
00:09:41,870 --> 00:09:42,550
Seriously.

169
00:09:42,750 --> 00:09:43,870
That won't do.

170
00:09:43,960 --> 00:09:45,600
As their children,

171
00:09:45,600 --> 00:09:47,390
there's no need to fuss over
who pays more.

172
00:09:47,390 --> 00:09:47,770
That won't do.

173
00:09:47,770 --> 00:09:49,120
We are family, you...

174
00:09:49,120 --> 00:09:50,600
But we still need to be clear about this.

175
00:09:50,600 --> 00:09:51,440
Okay.

176
00:09:51,870 --> 00:09:53,470
We can talk about this later.

177
00:09:53,720 --> 00:09:55,440
Here's my plan for this year.

178
00:09:55,720 --> 00:09:57,510
Since we are going to renovate that house

179
00:09:57,510 --> 00:09:58,510
in a few days,

180
00:09:58,510 --> 00:09:59,910
I want to bring Mom and Dad over

181
00:09:59,910 --> 00:10:01,360
to stay with us for a while.

182
00:10:01,360 --> 00:10:02,870
They can spend the New Year
at my place this year.

183
00:10:02,870 --> 00:10:04,510
My house is big, you see.

184
00:10:04,510 --> 00:10:05,910
You guys can all come over later,

185
00:10:05,910 --> 00:10:08,310
and we'll celebrate the New Year together.

186
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:09,510
Sure.

187
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:11,980
Then I'll go there early
on New Year's Eve

188
00:10:12,150 --> 00:10:13,670
and help you guys out.

189
00:10:14,120 --> 00:10:16,000
Why must we wait for the 30th day?

190
00:10:16,230 --> 00:10:17,720
Just go back with us later.

191
00:10:17,740 --> 00:10:19,200
That won't do.

192
00:10:19,240 --> 00:10:21,390
The supermarket needs manpower
during the New Year.

193
00:10:21,390 --> 00:10:24,650
Your brother-in-law and I
will be busy at the supermarket.

194
00:10:25,870 --> 00:10:27,070
Then, how about this?

195
00:10:27,440 --> 00:10:30,030
Let Zhixia and Zeqiu
go back with me first.

196
00:10:30,870 --> 00:10:32,150
I just bought a new computer.

197
00:10:32,150 --> 00:10:34,120
You two can take this chance to relax.

198
00:10:34,120 --> 00:10:35,200
It's a holiday after all.

199
00:10:35,200 --> 00:10:37,360
You can't just study
at home every day, right?

200
00:10:37,360 --> 00:10:38,440
No need, Uncle.

201
00:10:38,950 --> 00:10:41,000
We'll just stay at our own place.

202
00:10:41,150 --> 00:10:43,680
We have a lot of homework,
and it's quiet here.

203
00:10:43,870 --> 00:10:44,630
That's fine.

204
00:10:44,630 --> 00:10:46,030
We have a lot of rooms.

205
00:10:46,240 --> 00:10:47,790
I'll tidy up the biggest one

206
00:10:47,790 --> 00:10:49,630
just for the 3 of you to study in.

207
00:10:49,670 --> 00:10:50,480
That's right.

208
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:51,860
By then, the 3 of you...

209
00:10:52,390 --> 00:10:54,850
Goodness,
can you stop playing for a moment?

210
00:10:58,950 --> 00:11:00,030
My kid is good

211
00:11:00,030 --> 00:11:01,120
in every other aspect.

212
00:11:01,120 --> 00:11:03,410
But his grades trouble me so.

213
00:11:03,510 --> 00:11:04,480
I was planning

214
00:11:04,480 --> 00:11:05,600
to find him a tutor.

215
00:11:05,680 --> 00:11:06,910
But first, it's expensive.

216
00:11:06,910 --> 00:11:08,650
Second, he won't yield to any.

217
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:10,240
But with his own cousins,

218
00:11:10,240 --> 00:11:11,150
it's definitely different.

219
00:11:11,150 --> 00:11:11,870
Exactly.

220
00:11:12,240 --> 00:11:13,150
We know each other,

221
00:11:13,150 --> 00:11:16,270
and they'll surely be more responsible
than an outsider, right?

222
00:11:16,270 --> 00:11:17,030
Besides,

223
00:11:17,050 --> 00:11:18,960
with their excellent grades,

224
00:11:18,980 --> 00:11:21,030
helping him with his homework

225
00:11:21,030 --> 00:11:22,720
should be a piece of cake.

226
00:11:24,750 --> 00:11:26,320
You came all the way here

227
00:11:26,320 --> 00:11:27,720
just to say this?

228
00:11:28,720 --> 00:11:29,720
You didn't have to
go through the trouble.

229
00:11:29,720 --> 00:11:31,200
A phone call would have sufficed.

230
00:11:31,200 --> 00:11:32,470
That won't do.

231
00:11:32,490 --> 00:11:35,220
As your uncle,
I have to come pick you up in person.

232
00:11:35,630 --> 00:11:36,290
Uncle,

233
00:11:36,750 --> 00:11:38,030
Lin Zhixia means that

234
00:11:38,030 --> 00:11:39,670
if you had called,

235
00:11:39,840 --> 00:11:41,750
she would have rejected you over the phone

236
00:11:41,750 --> 00:11:43,150
so you wouldn't have
made a trip for nothing.

237
00:11:43,150 --> 00:11:44,200
That's what she means.

238
00:11:44,200 --> 00:11:46,030
What these two mean is,

239
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:47,640
they have good grades

240
00:11:47,910 --> 00:11:50,770
mostly because they love studying, right?

241
00:11:50,870 --> 00:11:52,510
A good student
is not necessarily a good teacher.

242
00:11:52,510 --> 00:11:55,200
They can't even help each other much.

243
00:11:57,360 --> 00:11:57,890
Uncle,

244
00:11:58,120 --> 00:12:00,200
studying really depends on oneself.

245
00:12:00,630 --> 00:12:02,790
Zeqiu and I just love studying.

246
00:12:03,080 --> 00:12:04,790
I think you should
pay attention to Zhuangzhuang

247
00:12:04,790 --> 00:12:07,050
and find out what his real interests are.

248
00:12:13,630 --> 00:12:14,670
Besides,

249
00:12:14,960 --> 00:12:17,090
we haven't seen each other for so long.

250
00:12:17,200 --> 00:12:18,080
You coming to me

251
00:12:18,080 --> 00:12:20,150
is no different from finding a tutor.

252
00:12:20,150 --> 00:12:20,790
I...

253
00:12:20,910 --> 00:12:22,480
Mom, I'm going to do my homework.

254
00:12:22,480 --> 00:12:23,550
Okay, go ahead.

255
00:12:35,480 --> 00:12:36,340
Eat something.

256
00:12:36,500 --> 00:12:37,960
We've just been chatting.

257
00:12:49,260 --> 00:12:51,420
[Input Text]

258
00:12:51,990 --> 00:12:54,910
[To: No Ordinary Human]

259
00:12:52,600 --> 00:12:54,840
Jiang Yubai, what are you doing?

260
00:13:03,490 --> 00:13:04,480
[Jiang Yubai, what are you doing?]

261
00:13:05,670 --> 00:13:08,320
[To: High-EQ Human]

262
00:13:08,350 --> 00:13:13,230
[Spacing out at home.]

263
00:13:09,390 --> 00:13:10,520
Spacing out at home.

264
00:13:16,600 --> 00:13:17,390
You?

265
00:13:17,150 --> 00:13:18,950
[Spacing out at home. You?]

266
00:13:26,840 --> 00:13:27,630
Son,

267
00:13:28,320 --> 00:13:30,250
you seem to be in a good mood lately.

268
00:13:30,550 --> 00:13:31,680
You're even texting

269
00:13:31,870 --> 00:13:33,360
with a smile on your face.

270
00:13:34,360 --> 00:13:35,150
Am I?

271
00:13:36,270 --> 00:13:37,120
Are you?

272
00:13:39,270 --> 00:13:40,800
I've seen it several times.

273
00:13:43,910 --> 00:13:44,670
Actually,

274
00:13:44,960 --> 00:13:46,320
I wanted to discuss

275
00:13:46,320 --> 00:13:47,780
our plans for the New Year.

276
00:13:48,510 --> 00:13:49,320
What plans?

277
00:13:50,960 --> 00:13:52,080
Your dad

278
00:13:52,480 --> 00:13:54,510
called this morning

279
00:13:54,630 --> 00:13:57,360
and said he bought you
a ticket to Singapore.

280
00:13:58,440 --> 00:13:59,200
I was thinking,

281
00:13:59,200 --> 00:14:01,390
you haven't seen him in years.

282
00:14:01,630 --> 00:14:03,480
Why not go visit him?

283
00:14:04,550 --> 00:14:06,210
He already booked the ticket.

284
00:14:06,550 --> 00:14:08,350
Is this a notice or a discussion?

285
00:14:09,150 --> 00:14:10,550
He hasn't changed at all.

286
00:14:10,750 --> 00:14:11,670
Still the same.

287
00:14:11,910 --> 00:14:14,120
Always putting his own needs first.

288
00:14:15,320 --> 00:14:16,380
When I was young, we followed him,

289
00:14:16,380 --> 00:14:18,860
moving between China and Singapore.

290
00:14:19,320 --> 00:14:20,630
Every time he gave an order,

291
00:14:20,630 --> 00:14:21,910
we had to follow.

292
00:14:22,240 --> 00:14:22,960
At school,

293
00:14:22,960 --> 00:14:25,290
I had to leave as soon as
I made new friends.

294
00:14:25,870 --> 00:14:28,200
Later, I didn't even dare to make friends.

295
00:14:29,270 --> 00:14:30,080
Is that so?

296
00:14:31,390 --> 00:14:32,790
Didn't I gradually realize

297
00:14:32,790 --> 00:14:34,030
this problem too?

298
00:14:35,720 --> 00:14:36,960
So after we divorced,

299
00:14:37,150 --> 00:14:38,910
I decided to bring you back

300
00:14:38,910 --> 00:14:40,440
to a familiar environment.

301
00:14:40,840 --> 00:14:42,670
You've been doing well lately,

302
00:14:42,670 --> 00:14:44,670
which proves my decision was right.

303
00:14:50,750 --> 00:14:52,550
If you don't want to go,

304
00:14:52,840 --> 00:14:53,910
we won't go.

305
00:14:54,440 --> 00:14:56,320
The way your dad does things

306
00:14:56,320 --> 00:14:58,080
is really annoying.

307
00:15:02,550 --> 00:15:03,840
But ultimately,

308
00:15:04,510 --> 00:15:06,240
isn't it because he misses you?

309
00:15:07,550 --> 00:15:08,390
He just wants

310
00:15:08,390 --> 00:15:10,930
to use the New Year as an opportunity

311
00:15:10,960 --> 00:15:13,370
to express his feelings to you.

312
00:15:13,440 --> 00:15:14,120
Mom,

313
00:15:14,600 --> 00:15:15,270
you and Dad

314
00:15:15,270 --> 00:15:17,470
are completely from different worlds.

315
00:15:17,510 --> 00:15:19,030
Besides, he betrayed you back then.

316
00:15:19,030 --> 00:15:20,890
Why do you always speak up for him?

317
00:15:23,080 --> 00:15:24,910
Matters between adults are
often complicated, helpless,

318
00:15:24,910 --> 00:15:26,040
and hard to explain.

319
00:15:29,150 --> 00:15:30,390
Your dad

320
00:15:30,630 --> 00:15:32,600
is certainly not a good husband.

321
00:15:33,270 --> 00:15:35,360
But that does not affect

322
00:15:35,360 --> 00:15:39,270
his sincere love and concern for his son.

323
00:15:44,360 --> 00:15:45,150
Then,

324
00:15:46,960 --> 00:15:48,360
do you want me to go?

325
00:15:49,750 --> 00:15:51,790
Of course, I respect your decision.

326
00:15:52,750 --> 00:15:53,390
But...

327
00:15:54,200 --> 00:15:56,800
I don't want to leave you alone
for the New Year.

328
00:15:58,390 --> 00:16:00,550
You don't have to worry about me.

329
00:16:01,240 --> 00:16:02,240
I haven't seen

330
00:16:02,360 --> 00:16:04,200
your grandparents for a long time either.

331
00:16:04,200 --> 00:16:06,670
So I can take this chance to visit them.

332
00:16:10,550 --> 00:16:11,480
Okay.

333
00:16:13,030 --> 00:16:13,840
Then,

334
00:16:16,870 --> 00:16:18,150
I'll go.

335
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:20,910
It's a deal.

336
00:16:22,720 --> 00:16:23,510
Okay.

337
00:16:24,670 --> 00:16:26,550
Visit with a good mood.

338
00:16:27,750 --> 00:16:28,550
I'm leaving.

339
00:16:42,440 --> 00:16:44,440
Two relatives showed up uninvited,

340
00:16:44,630 --> 00:16:45,690
it's suffocating.

341
00:16:54,360 --> 00:16:56,120
Do you want to come out and hide?

342
00:17:00,650 --> 00:17:03,240
Nothing good ever happens
when my uncle and aunt show up.

343
00:17:03,240 --> 00:17:04,440
When they were young,

344
00:17:04,510 --> 00:17:05,550
my mom gave my uncle

345
00:17:05,550 --> 00:17:07,220
her opportunity to go to school.

346
00:17:07,220 --> 00:17:09,640
He finished college and became a lawyer,

347
00:17:09,640 --> 00:17:11,300
but when he looked at my mom...

348
00:17:12,589 --> 00:17:14,480
His gaze was full of disdain.

349
00:17:15,260 --> 00:17:16,440
Also, when Zeqiu was little,

350
00:17:16,440 --> 00:17:17,970
he was sick and needed surgery.

351
00:17:17,970 --> 00:17:20,930
My parents couldn't scrape
together enough money,

352
00:17:21,109 --> 00:17:22,790
so they had to borrow from my uncle.

353
00:17:22,790 --> 00:17:25,000
But he said he didn't have a single cent.

354
00:17:25,589 --> 00:17:26,829
And now look at him.

355
00:17:26,829 --> 00:17:28,349
He has the nerve to come to my house

356
00:17:28,349 --> 00:17:29,200
and ask Zeqiu and me

357
00:17:29,200 --> 00:17:30,920
to be free tutors for his son.

358
00:17:31,030 --> 00:17:31,960
So ridiculous.

359
00:17:45,550 --> 00:17:46,350
What's wrong?

360
00:17:47,240 --> 00:17:48,480
It's the first time I've seen you

361
00:17:48,480 --> 00:17:49,880
say so much in one breath.

362
00:17:51,840 --> 00:17:55,440
This kind of thing is exactly what
you vent to good friends about.

363
00:17:56,000 --> 00:17:57,930
I feel much better after saying it.

364
00:17:57,960 --> 00:17:59,110
Do you have any trouble?

365
00:17:59,110 --> 00:18:00,440
You can tell me about it.

366
00:18:07,720 --> 00:18:08,550
I don't think

367
00:18:09,550 --> 00:18:11,180
I have anything to vent about.

368
00:18:11,180 --> 00:18:12,200
That's good.

369
00:18:17,880 --> 00:18:18,790
He

370
00:18:18,790 --> 00:18:21,350
really wanted to be
involved in your growth,

371
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:23,110
but because his method was wrong,

372
00:18:23,110 --> 00:18:25,550
it got interpreted as control.

373
00:18:26,110 --> 00:18:28,640
You'll understand when you enter society.

374
00:18:28,830 --> 00:18:30,350
He is your family,

375
00:18:30,830 --> 00:18:32,030
a family member who

376
00:18:32,330 --> 00:18:36,030
would never harm you no matter what.

377
00:18:49,450 --> 00:18:51,910
When I was young,
I always looked up to my dad.

378
00:18:53,110 --> 00:18:54,200
He was successful,

379
00:18:54,920 --> 00:18:55,790
capable,

380
00:18:57,640 --> 00:18:58,880
and quite handsome.

381
00:19:00,270 --> 00:19:01,640
He was always

382
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:03,800
a perfect role model in my heart.

383
00:19:04,700 --> 00:19:05,840
So I never thought that

384
00:19:05,840 --> 00:19:07,500
he would betray my mom one day.

385
00:19:09,480 --> 00:19:10,200
Since that day,

386
00:19:10,200 --> 00:19:12,110
his image in my heart collapsed.

387
00:19:12,640 --> 00:19:14,370
It had a pretty big impact on me.

388
00:19:15,510 --> 00:19:17,570
It was as if all the evidence of beauty

389
00:19:17,960 --> 00:19:22,000
and happiness in my heart disappeared.

390
00:19:23,920 --> 00:19:25,310
Since then, my relationship with him

391
00:19:25,310 --> 00:19:26,570
has become very tense.

392
00:19:27,860 --> 00:19:28,980
Even now, I don't know

393
00:19:28,980 --> 00:19:31,110
how to persuade myself to forgive him.

394
00:19:38,000 --> 00:19:39,200
Today he just booked me

395
00:19:39,200 --> 00:19:40,510
a ticket to Singapore.

396
00:19:41,830 --> 00:19:43,070
But I'm not sure

397
00:19:43,880 --> 00:19:45,830
if I can properly face him

398
00:19:47,070 --> 00:19:48,270
and his new family.

399
00:19:57,380 --> 00:19:59,160
It's also my first time hearing you

400
00:19:59,160 --> 00:20:00,560
say so much in one breath.

401
00:20:04,730 --> 00:20:06,550
Are you feeling better now?

402
00:20:08,960 --> 00:20:09,750
Much better.

403
00:20:12,070 --> 00:20:13,440
Sometimes I think how nice

404
00:20:13,440 --> 00:20:14,160
it'd be if we could

405
00:20:14,160 --> 00:20:15,790
freely choose our family.

406
00:20:18,730 --> 00:20:19,880
Could it be that

407
00:20:20,660 --> 00:20:21,700
we've already been

408
00:20:21,700 --> 00:20:23,100
quietly making choices?

409
00:20:24,200 --> 00:20:26,330
Staying away from people who hurt you,

410
00:20:26,350 --> 00:20:28,480
getting close to the ones who warm you,

411
00:20:28,550 --> 00:20:31,810
and keeping a place in your heart
for the important people.

412
00:20:32,350 --> 00:20:33,150
These actions

413
00:20:33,590 --> 00:20:35,310
are all redefining family.

414
00:20:56,920 --> 00:20:58,790
I want to discuss something with you two.

415
00:20:58,790 --> 00:21:00,160
Your dad and I are going to
your uncle's house for the New Year

416
00:21:00,160 --> 00:21:01,310
to keep your grandparents company.

417
00:21:01,310 --> 00:21:02,110
You two...

418
00:21:02,110 --> 00:21:02,960
I'm not going.

419
00:21:04,200 --> 00:21:04,880
Zhixia.

420
00:21:08,590 --> 00:21:09,350
You guys go.

421
00:21:09,350 --> 00:21:10,550
I'll stay home alone.

422
00:21:12,310 --> 00:21:13,400
Can you cook?

423
00:21:14,440 --> 00:21:16,560
What are you going to eat alone at home?

424
00:21:16,560 --> 00:21:18,240
Leave me the keys to the supermarket,

425
00:21:18,240 --> 00:21:19,310
and I won't go hungry.

426
00:21:19,310 --> 00:21:21,970
No way. You can't just eat those
for the New Year.

427
00:21:23,160 --> 00:21:24,480
You know exactly what

428
00:21:24,480 --> 00:21:25,830
Uncle and Aunt are like.

429
00:21:26,320 --> 00:21:28,310
If it weren't for Mom's sake,

430
00:21:28,350 --> 00:21:30,280
I would have lost my temper long ago

431
00:21:30,310 --> 00:21:32,240
over the demands he made last time.

432
00:21:33,920 --> 00:21:36,310
I also think his demands
were quite unreasonable.

433
00:21:36,310 --> 00:21:38,110
That's why I didn't ask you to go early.

434
00:21:38,110 --> 00:21:39,570
It's just for the New Year.

435
00:21:39,720 --> 00:21:42,050
I want to spend the New Year
with my family.

436
00:21:43,750 --> 00:21:46,210
Those relatives
don't treat us like family.

437
00:21:46,400 --> 00:21:48,400
Why should we treat them like family

438
00:21:48,400 --> 00:21:49,660
and try to please them?

439
00:21:53,880 --> 00:21:55,350
How about this? I'll stay.

440
00:21:58,070 --> 00:21:59,070
I'll cook for you.

441
00:21:59,880 --> 00:22:00,680
Really?

442
00:22:02,880 --> 00:22:03,830
That's great.

443
00:22:04,240 --> 00:22:05,640
Then I can eat

444
00:22:05,800 --> 00:22:07,510
tomato salad, cola chicken wings,

445
00:22:07,510 --> 00:22:08,720
eight-treasure rice,
and braised spare ribs.

446
00:22:08,720 --> 00:22:09,480
Okay, that's enough.

447
00:22:09,480 --> 00:22:11,140
I can't make that many dishes.

448
00:22:11,550 --> 00:22:13,110
As long as we don't go hungry, it's fine.

449
00:22:13,110 --> 00:22:14,350
These two kids.

450
00:22:14,440 --> 00:22:15,880
All right, it's settled then.

451
00:22:15,880 --> 00:22:17,400
Take good care of your sister at home.

452
00:22:17,400 --> 00:22:19,550
Your dad and I will be back
in a few days, okay?

453
00:22:19,550 --> 00:22:20,550
-Okay.
-Okay.

454
00:22:27,720 --> 00:22:30,770
[To: No Ordinary Human]

455
00:22:30,050 --> 00:22:32,290
My parents agreed to let me
not go to my uncle's house.

456
00:22:32,290 --> 00:22:35,150
I can spend the New Year at home
with Zeqiu this year.

457
00:22:40,890 --> 00:22:47,770
[From: No Ordinary Human]

458
00:22:41,940 --> 00:22:43,200
My flight is tomorrow.

459
00:23:02,030 --> 00:23:03,350
Be careful on the way.

460
00:23:03,440 --> 00:23:04,900
Text me when you're there.

461
00:23:09,750 --> 00:23:10,480
Got it.

462
00:23:46,550 --> 00:23:47,200
Dad.

463
00:23:47,720 --> 00:23:49,350
Son, are you on your way?

464
00:23:50,030 --> 00:23:52,680
Your Aunt Wu has already
made the dumplings.

465
00:23:52,830 --> 00:23:54,360
We're just waiting for you.

466
00:23:55,400 --> 00:23:56,310
I'm on my way.

467
00:23:56,310 --> 00:23:57,030
Okay.

468
00:23:57,350 --> 00:23:59,410
Just contact Uncle Kun when you land.

469
00:23:59,590 --> 00:24:01,390
He'll pick you up at the airport.

470
00:24:02,200 --> 00:24:03,590
Jiang Feng, come take a look.

471
00:24:03,590 --> 00:24:04,850
The baby keeps crying.

472
00:24:05,960 --> 00:24:07,690
Wait a minute. I'm on the phone.

473
00:24:08,310 --> 00:24:09,090
Don't cry. Don't cry.

474
00:24:09,090 --> 00:24:10,420
Daddy will be here soon.

475
00:24:10,590 --> 00:24:11,880
Jiang Feng, hurry up.

476
00:24:12,440 --> 00:24:13,640
Be careful on the way.

477
00:24:13,830 --> 00:24:15,070
Tell me what you want to eat.

478
00:24:15,070 --> 00:24:16,510
It's your first time coming to our house.

479
00:24:16,510 --> 00:24:18,440
I just realized my ID isn't with me.

480
00:24:18,770 --> 00:24:19,700
I have to go back.

481
00:24:21,090 --> 00:24:22,420
If I still can't find it,

482
00:24:23,880 --> 00:24:24,830
go on without me.

483
00:24:25,270 --> 00:24:26,240
Hello? Son?

484
00:24:34,300 --> 00:24:36,450
[Passport]

485
00:24:42,240 --> 00:24:43,100
Is it straight?

486
00:24:43,400 --> 00:24:44,190
Yeah, it's pretty straight.

487
00:24:44,190 --> 00:24:45,720
Why do I feel like
the left side is higher?

488
00:24:45,720 --> 00:24:46,880
I actually think the left side is lower.

489
00:24:46,880 --> 00:24:47,590
Really?

490
00:24:47,590 --> 00:24:48,160
Okay.

491
00:24:48,160 --> 00:24:49,420
-Tingting.
-How is it?

492
00:24:49,590 --> 00:24:51,320
-Dad is back.
-Your dad's back.

493
00:24:51,590 --> 00:24:52,710
Dad!

494
00:24:54,310 --> 00:24:55,440
I missed you so much.

495
00:24:55,550 --> 00:24:56,350
What took you so long?

496
00:24:56,350 --> 00:24:58,750
By my calculations,
you should have arrived this morning.

497
00:24:58,750 --> 00:24:59,680
I went

498
00:24:59,880 --> 00:25:01,680
to buy a gift for Tingting.

499
00:25:02,440 --> 00:25:03,110
For me?

500
00:25:03,110 --> 00:25:05,110
More like a gift package. It's huge.

501
00:25:05,680 --> 00:25:06,440
She really is your own.

502
00:25:06,440 --> 00:25:07,830
What is it?

503
00:25:09,480 --> 00:25:10,480
It looks so good.

504
00:25:10,590 --> 00:25:11,880
This color is so nice.

505
00:25:11,880 --> 00:25:12,750
Of course.

506
00:25:12,920 --> 00:25:14,640
Well? Do you like it?

507
00:25:15,200 --> 00:25:17,270
Dad, do you fathers all think that

508
00:25:17,270 --> 00:25:18,880
girls like pink their whole lives?

509
00:25:18,880 --> 00:25:20,160
This is way too pink.

510
00:25:20,960 --> 00:25:23,160
It's perfect for the New Year. So festive.

511
00:25:23,160 --> 00:25:24,000
Look at this color.

512
00:25:24,000 --> 00:25:25,930
You'd look great in it. It's yours.

513
00:25:27,160 --> 00:25:28,000
Well...

514
00:25:28,070 --> 00:25:29,270
I can actually fit in this size.

515
00:25:29,270 --> 00:25:30,200
You'll look great in it.

516
00:25:30,200 --> 00:25:31,000
Very nice.

517
00:25:31,480 --> 00:25:32,270
Tingting,

518
00:25:32,640 --> 00:25:34,070
in Daddy's heart,

519
00:25:34,070 --> 00:25:36,200
haven't you always been a little girl?

520
00:25:36,400 --> 00:25:37,000
Yes.

521
00:25:37,000 --> 00:25:39,350
So, how did your exams go this year?

522
00:25:39,640 --> 00:25:41,970
Don't talk about that during the New Year.

523
00:25:42,640 --> 00:25:43,920
Tingting and I went to make a wish.

524
00:25:43,920 --> 00:25:45,000
They said you shouldn't
keep talking about it,

525
00:25:45,000 --> 00:25:46,200
or it won't come true.

526
00:25:48,000 --> 00:25:49,600
Okay, not another word of it.

527
00:25:49,690 --> 00:25:51,830
Let's cook then.

528
00:25:51,830 --> 00:25:53,070
Hurry up. We were waiting for you.

529
00:25:53,070 --> 00:25:53,750
I'm starving.

530
00:25:53,750 --> 00:25:54,510
I'll go wash my hands.

531
00:25:54,510 --> 00:25:55,510
Honestly.

532
00:25:56,070 --> 00:25:57,480
This one seems okay.

533
00:26:00,750 --> 00:26:05,490
[New Year's Eve dinner]

534
00:26:03,880 --> 00:26:04,680
Leek.

535
00:26:04,880 --> 00:26:05,440
Leak?

536
00:26:05,550 --> 00:26:06,310
Leek.

537
00:26:06,710 --> 00:26:07,620
[New Year's Eve dinner]

538
00:26:06,920 --> 00:26:07,720
Leak?

539
00:26:07,720 --> 00:26:08,480
Leek!

540
00:26:08,810 --> 00:26:10,710
[New Year's Eve dinner]

541
00:26:09,960 --> 00:26:10,830
Big or small?

542
00:26:10,830 --> 00:26:11,790
A big one.

543
00:26:14,720 --> 00:26:15,480
Aren't you going to slice it?

544
00:26:15,480 --> 00:26:16,200
You didn't tell me to.

545
00:26:16,200 --> 00:26:18,110
If I tell you now, will you slice it?

546
00:26:18,110 --> 00:26:19,030
Forget it.

547
00:26:21,960 --> 00:26:23,070
It's getting burnt, Zeqiu.

548
00:26:23,070 --> 00:26:24,350
Okay, here, take this.

549
00:26:25,440 --> 00:26:26,680
Is this step correct?

550
00:26:26,680 --> 00:26:27,720
Of course it is.

551
00:26:27,920 --> 00:26:30,110
You're not controlling the heat very well.

552
00:26:30,110 --> 00:26:32,040
I'm not controlling the heat well?

553
00:26:32,240 --> 00:26:33,970
It's definitely your problem.

554
00:26:36,440 --> 00:26:39,030
Come on, who was the one
who swore confidently that

555
00:26:39,030 --> 00:26:40,480
we'd never eat instant noodles
for New Year's Eve dinner?

556
00:26:40,480 --> 00:26:41,880
Stop talking. Salt.

557
00:26:41,880 --> 00:26:42,680
Add some salt.

558
00:26:48,000 --> 00:26:49,030
Look for it.

559
00:26:57,750 --> 00:26:58,880
Isn't that too much?

560
00:26:58,920 --> 00:26:59,640
It's fine.

561
00:26:59,780 --> 00:27:01,200
It'll be flavorful and delicious.

562
00:27:01,200 --> 00:27:02,070
Who's gonna eat this?

563
00:27:02,070 --> 00:27:02,960
You, you.

564
00:27:02,960 --> 00:27:04,020
You can have it all.

565
00:27:06,240 --> 00:27:07,000
Coming!

566
00:27:14,640 --> 00:27:15,550
Jiang Yubai?

567
00:27:16,680 --> 00:27:20,310
Lin Zhixia, I'm here to wish you
a Happy New Year's Eve.

568
00:27:23,000 --> 00:27:24,530
You didn't go to Singapore?

569
00:27:27,160 --> 00:27:27,960
Lin Zhixia!

570
00:27:29,000 --> 00:27:30,000
Where did you go?

571
00:27:30,400 --> 00:27:32,530
-Come in.
-Was that salt you passed me?

572
00:27:33,160 --> 00:27:33,880
Yeah.

573
00:27:34,880 --> 00:27:36,080
Everything browned.

574
00:27:37,440 --> 00:27:38,510
I even tasted it.

575
00:27:40,350 --> 00:27:41,280
Why are you here?

576
00:27:42,200 --> 00:27:44,480
I originally came to say hi to Lin Zhixia.

577
00:27:44,760 --> 00:27:46,160
But now I think

578
00:27:46,480 --> 00:27:47,830
I can be more useful.

579
00:27:49,030 --> 00:27:50,360
You know how to fix a wok?

580
00:28:43,000 --> 00:28:44,930
May you have abundance every year.

581
00:28:48,510 --> 00:28:50,070
How about we have hot pot?

582
00:28:51,590 --> 00:28:52,310
Sure.

583
00:28:54,880 --> 00:28:56,210
I'm fine with anything.

584
00:28:59,030 --> 00:28:59,660
I know.

585
00:29:00,120 --> 00:29:02,550
[Shen]

586
00:29:00,270 --> 00:29:02,000
Didn't you tell me that before?

587
00:29:02,480 --> 00:29:04,110
What about next year?

588
00:29:04,830 --> 00:29:06,360
Can you come back next year?

589
00:29:07,530 --> 00:29:08,330
Next year?

590
00:29:09,700 --> 00:29:11,350
I do have a vacation next year.

591
00:29:11,350 --> 00:29:12,480
But it's hard to say.

592
00:29:13,030 --> 00:29:15,440
It depends on the arrangements
at the observation station.

593
00:29:15,440 --> 00:29:18,440
Our family has gotten used to it
after all these years.

594
00:29:18,550 --> 00:29:20,350
Have a good New Year with our son.

595
00:29:25,330 --> 00:29:25,790
Okay.

596
00:29:26,290 --> 00:29:27,220
Hold on a second.

597
00:29:33,920 --> 00:29:35,310
Happy New Year, Dad.

598
00:29:36,270 --> 00:29:37,400
Happy New Year, Son.

599
00:29:38,310 --> 00:29:39,680
I'm hanging up now.

600
00:29:46,030 --> 00:29:48,000
Why are there still

601
00:29:48,070 --> 00:29:50,240
so many people eating out
on New Year's Eve?

602
00:29:50,240 --> 00:29:52,200
Yeah, it's quite normal.

603
00:29:52,310 --> 00:29:54,160
Everyone is getting busier nowadays.

604
00:29:54,160 --> 00:29:55,440
Actually, people have gradually

605
00:29:55,440 --> 00:29:58,770
come to accept having New Year's Eve
dinner at a restaurant.

606
00:29:59,640 --> 00:30:00,310
Is that so?

607
00:30:01,310 --> 00:30:02,440
Why do I feel like...

608
00:30:04,880 --> 00:30:07,740
it's just because someone
doesn't know how to cook?

609
00:30:10,880 --> 00:30:13,210
You were waiting to say that, weren't you?

610
00:30:19,000 --> 00:30:20,000
Waiter.

611
00:30:22,290 --> 00:30:23,690
Hello, how can I help you?

612
00:30:23,790 --> 00:30:24,400
Hello.

613
00:30:24,720 --> 00:30:27,680
What about the 4 extra portions
of dumplings I ordered earlier?

614
00:30:27,680 --> 00:30:28,740
They've been packed for you

615
00:30:28,740 --> 00:30:29,900
-and placed at the reception.
-Okay. Thank you.

616
00:30:29,900 --> 00:30:30,830
You're welcome.

617
00:30:34,310 --> 00:30:36,310
Are you going back to the dorm later?

618
00:30:36,550 --> 00:30:37,350
I have to.

619
00:30:37,830 --> 00:30:40,030
There are quite a few projects
this semester.

620
00:30:40,030 --> 00:30:41,110
Two of my master's students

621
00:30:41,110 --> 00:30:42,850
aren't planning
to go home for the New Year.

622
00:30:42,850 --> 00:30:45,310
And two others
simply couldn't get tickets.

623
00:30:45,400 --> 00:30:46,310
So I'll

624
00:30:46,390 --> 00:30:47,750
bring them some food and check on them.

625
00:30:47,750 --> 00:30:49,410
They are just kids, after all.

626
00:31:06,960 --> 00:31:08,030
Don't worry.

627
00:31:08,310 --> 00:31:09,910
I've made arrangements too.

628
00:31:10,070 --> 00:31:10,920
Tomorrow,

629
00:31:11,310 --> 00:31:12,640
I'll take a proper break

630
00:31:12,880 --> 00:31:14,140
and stay home with you.

631
00:31:14,180 --> 00:31:14,810
Okay?

632
00:31:15,830 --> 00:31:16,290
Okay.

633
00:31:17,830 --> 00:31:18,640
You eat too.

634
00:31:25,510 --> 00:31:26,310
Waiter.

635
00:31:29,550 --> 00:31:30,200
Yes?

636
00:31:30,200 --> 00:31:31,270
Bill, please.

637
00:31:31,390 --> 00:31:32,510
This way to the reception desk.

638
00:31:32,510 --> 00:31:33,160
Okay.

639
00:31:39,480 --> 00:31:42,070
Happy New Year!

640
00:31:42,720 --> 00:31:43,930
May all your wishes come true.

641
00:31:43,930 --> 00:31:46,330
Look at you, sweetie.
You're so good with words.

642
00:31:46,330 --> 00:31:47,530
Thank you, Grandma.

643
00:31:49,290 --> 00:31:50,220
Eat more.

644
00:31:55,250 --> 00:31:56,270
Is it delicious?

645
00:31:56,350 --> 00:31:57,010
Delicious.

646
00:32:00,960 --> 00:32:01,760
Are you happy?

647
00:32:02,270 --> 00:32:04,270
Grandma, give me a big red envelope.

648
00:32:04,980 --> 00:32:06,180
Is that all you're thinking about?

649
00:32:05,290 --> 00:32:09,040
[Contacts]

650
00:32:18,800 --> 00:32:19,380
[Contacts]

651
00:32:19,450 --> 00:32:25,850
[Call Lin Zhixia]

652
00:32:25,640 --> 00:32:27,070
Jiang Yubai, to your left.

653
00:32:27,070 --> 00:32:27,920
Left?

654
00:32:34,200 --> 00:32:35,330
Hello, Shen Fuxuan.

655
00:32:35,480 --> 00:32:36,680
Happy New Year's Eve.

656
00:32:37,310 --> 00:32:38,510
We haven't eaten yet.

657
00:32:40,640 --> 00:32:42,550
Me, my brother, and Jiang Yubai.

658
00:32:43,920 --> 00:32:44,980
You're coming too?

659
00:32:48,330 --> 00:32:49,590
Pair of tens.

660
00:32:50,880 --> 00:32:52,030
Anyone want a pair of twos?

661
00:32:52,030 --> 00:32:52,830
Anyone?

662
00:32:52,830 --> 00:32:54,030
Bomb.

663
00:32:54,270 --> 00:32:54,750
Nice!

664
00:32:54,750 --> 00:32:55,590
Hold it.

665
00:32:55,680 --> 00:32:56,880
Four Kings!

666
00:32:58,000 --> 00:32:59,270
Mom, I won again.

667
00:32:59,270 --> 00:33:01,070
I haven't lost all night.

668
00:33:01,510 --> 00:33:02,460
Stick it on.

669
00:33:03,330 --> 00:33:05,180
My face is so clean.

670
00:33:05,490 --> 00:33:07,140
A certain kid
isn't allowed to cry tonight.

671
00:33:07,140 --> 00:33:08,050
I won't cry.

672
00:33:08,050 --> 00:33:08,570
Honey.

673
00:33:08,570 --> 00:33:10,770
I'll definitely win it back next round.

674
00:33:12,530 --> 00:33:14,220
Who is it? Go open the door.

675
00:33:15,380 --> 00:33:16,290
You're cheating.

676
00:33:16,290 --> 00:33:17,500
Who's cheating?

677
00:33:19,220 --> 00:33:20,220
Why are you here?

678
00:33:20,420 --> 00:33:21,090
Uncle, Aunt,

679
00:33:21,090 --> 00:33:23,020
Grandpa, Grandma, Happy New Year.

680
00:33:23,140 --> 00:33:25,610
My mom specially made this stewed meat,

681
00:33:25,610 --> 00:33:26,980
and asked me to bring some to you.

682
00:33:26,980 --> 00:33:27,700
There's some for the Lins too.

683
00:33:27,700 --> 00:33:29,010
I'm bringing it to them later.

684
00:33:29,010 --> 00:33:30,090
Thank your mom for us.

685
00:33:30,090 --> 00:33:30,980
Duan.

686
00:33:31,610 --> 00:33:33,090
Dad, Mom, look at this kid.

687
00:33:33,090 --> 00:33:34,460
He's just a late bloomer.

688
00:33:34,460 --> 00:33:35,810
He wasn't this tall last year.

689
00:33:35,810 --> 00:33:36,670
He's grown now.

690
00:33:36,770 --> 00:33:37,460
Right, Uncle?

691
00:33:37,460 --> 00:33:39,250
I can even dunk this year.

692
00:33:39,770 --> 00:33:41,940
All brawn and no brains.

693
00:33:42,570 --> 00:33:43,900
Watch your mouth.

694
00:33:43,900 --> 00:33:46,230
Duan's grades are much better than yours.

695
00:33:46,330 --> 00:33:47,130
That's right.

696
00:33:49,140 --> 00:33:50,000
How's your dad?

697
00:33:50,180 --> 00:33:51,980
Playing cards at home too?

698
00:33:52,660 --> 00:33:53,770
Yes.

699
00:33:53,900 --> 00:33:56,250
They started playing
right after an early dinner.

700
00:33:56,250 --> 00:33:56,940
All right.

701
00:33:57,160 --> 00:34:00,010
I'll go over and play
a few rounds with your dad later.

702
00:34:00,010 --> 00:34:00,770
Save it.

703
00:34:00,770 --> 00:34:02,290
Did they invite you?

704
00:34:02,310 --> 00:34:03,850
We're practically family.

705
00:34:05,180 --> 00:34:05,940
By the way,

706
00:34:06,180 --> 00:34:07,460
the two kids from the Lin family

707
00:34:07,460 --> 00:34:09,050
didn't go to their grandma's today.

708
00:34:09,050 --> 00:34:10,460
Tingting,

709
00:34:10,460 --> 00:34:11,730
go to the kitchen

710
00:34:11,730 --> 00:34:14,570
and bring them the big bag of snacks
I bought this afternoon.

711
00:34:14,570 --> 00:34:15,980
No need.

712
00:34:16,010 --> 00:34:17,900
They don't lack this kind of stuff.

713
00:34:17,900 --> 00:34:21,560
I'm waiting for the Spring Festival Gala
to watch my idol perform.

714
00:34:23,130 --> 00:34:25,500
Shouldn't we kids hang out too?

715
00:34:26,780 --> 00:34:27,500
Exactly.

716
00:34:27,500 --> 00:34:28,900
Go on, have fun.

717
00:34:29,230 --> 00:34:29,980
Let's go.

718
00:34:31,340 --> 00:34:32,090
Fine.

719
00:34:32,980 --> 00:34:34,530
Grandpa, Grandma,
I'll go hang out for a bit

720
00:34:34,530 --> 00:34:35,659
and come back later.

721
00:34:35,820 --> 00:34:36,460
Bye.

722
00:34:36,460 --> 00:34:37,260
Bye, Uncle, Aunt.

723
00:34:37,260 --> 00:34:38,590
Bye, Grandpa, Grandma.

724
00:34:43,610 --> 00:34:44,540
Have a meatball.

725
00:34:44,860 --> 00:34:45,650
Delicious.

726
00:34:46,780 --> 00:34:47,570
This...

727
00:34:47,650 --> 00:34:49,110
This should be cooked too.

728
00:34:50,260 --> 00:34:51,380
Crab sticks.

729
00:34:54,090 --> 00:34:55,290
Eat it while it's hot.

730
00:34:55,489 --> 00:34:56,500
Thank you.

731
00:34:58,010 --> 00:34:58,940
Potatoes.

732
00:34:59,380 --> 00:35:00,210
Just eat.

733
00:35:02,940 --> 00:35:03,780
Thanks.

734
00:35:07,860 --> 00:35:08,650
Hot, hot!

735
00:35:10,450 --> 00:35:11,650
Someone's knocking.

736
00:35:11,690 --> 00:35:13,260
Who is it this time?

737
00:35:13,650 --> 00:35:14,340
There's someone else?

738
00:35:13,980 --> 00:35:15,870
[Harmony brings prosperity]

739
00:35:14,340 --> 00:35:15,940
It's really lively tonight.

740
00:35:16,300 --> 00:35:17,900
-Happy New Year.
-Happy New Year.

741
00:35:17,900 --> 00:35:18,820
You guys are here.

742
00:35:18,820 --> 00:35:19,300
Come in.

743
00:35:19,340 --> 00:35:20,200
Happy New Year.

744
00:35:20,210 --> 00:35:20,940
Happy New Year.

745
00:35:20,940 --> 00:35:22,730
-Gotta spend the New Year with you guys.
-Who is it?

746
00:35:22,730 --> 00:35:23,260
Duan Qiyan.

747
00:35:23,260 --> 00:35:24,010
You sneaked out.

748
00:35:24,010 --> 00:35:25,050
-Happy New Year.
-Happy New Year.

749
00:35:25,050 --> 00:35:26,570
Perfect timing. We're eating.

750
00:35:26,570 --> 00:35:27,260
Really?

751
00:35:29,170 --> 00:35:30,130
Jiang, Shen?

752
00:35:30,130 --> 00:35:31,210
Why are you guys here?

753
00:35:31,210 --> 00:35:31,980
-We…
-I...

754
00:35:31,980 --> 00:35:33,460
-I’m bored. I’m here to celebrate.
-Celebrate the New Year, yes.

755
00:35:33,460 --> 00:35:34,790
Let's sit down and talk.

756
00:35:35,540 --> 00:35:42,090
[Harmony brings prosperity]

757
00:35:37,500 --> 00:35:40,500
My dad made braised pork ribs

758
00:35:40,500 --> 00:35:42,010
and stir-fried beef with bamboo shoots.

759
00:35:42,010 --> 00:35:43,210
They're really good.

760
00:35:43,420 --> 00:35:44,730
Mr. Duan's specialty.

761
00:35:45,050 --> 00:35:45,860
Of course.

762
00:35:46,530 --> 00:35:47,660
Is the opening over?

763
00:35:48,000 --> 00:35:48,530
It's over.

764
00:35:48,530 --> 00:35:50,860
Your idol had
a lot of screen time just now.

765
00:35:51,840 --> 00:35:53,690
Duan Qiyan, it's all your fault.

766
00:35:53,960 --> 00:35:54,710
You fell hard on your butt,

767
00:35:54,710 --> 00:35:56,440
and made me miss seeing my idol.

768
00:35:56,460 --> 00:35:58,150
Well, why were you so anxious?

769
00:35:58,420 --> 00:35:59,480
It was because you rushed me

770
00:35:59,480 --> 00:36:00,590
that I fell and bruised my butt,

771
00:36:00,590 --> 00:36:02,210
and you don't even feel sorry for me.

772
00:36:02,210 --> 00:36:03,050
Let me tell you,

773
00:36:03,050 --> 00:36:05,110
the Spring Festival Gala
will be replayed for 3 days.

774
00:36:05,110 --> 00:36:06,460
Don't worry.

775
00:36:07,210 --> 00:36:07,940
Replayed?

776
00:36:08,420 --> 00:36:09,650
I don't care.
Anyway, I've been looking forward

777
00:36:09,650 --> 00:36:11,010
to their performance since
the announcement.

778
00:36:11,010 --> 00:36:12,260
You have to take responsibility for this.

779
00:36:12,260 --> 00:36:13,010
Okay, okay.

780
00:36:13,010 --> 00:36:13,810
Okay, my lady.

781
00:36:14,070 --> 00:36:15,610
I'll set an alarm

782
00:36:16,590 --> 00:36:19,480
and let you know
as soon as the replay starts,

783
00:36:19,650 --> 00:36:20,300
okay?

784
00:36:20,840 --> 00:36:21,590
Fine.

785
00:36:21,590 --> 00:36:22,400
You two, quiet down.

786
00:36:22,400 --> 00:36:23,550
You're so noisy right after you arrived.

787
00:36:23,550 --> 00:36:25,320
Alright, alright,
stop arguing during the New Year.

788
00:36:25,320 --> 00:36:26,570
Are you two kids?

789
00:36:28,670 --> 00:36:29,480
The ones on top are cooked.

790
00:36:29,480 --> 00:36:30,410
You can eat them.

791
00:36:30,590 --> 00:36:31,710
So delicious. Grab some.

792
00:36:31,710 --> 00:36:32,400
Just you.

793
00:36:32,550 --> 00:36:34,110
The beef meatball hit me.

794
00:36:34,800 --> 00:36:35,710
Hit it back.

795
00:36:36,880 --> 00:36:38,550
It's so lively. It's so good.

796
00:36:38,760 --> 00:36:39,900
Originally, for this New Year,

797
00:36:39,900 --> 00:36:41,710
I thought
I'd just spend it with my sister.

798
00:36:41,710 --> 00:36:42,860
But everyone came.

799
00:36:43,480 --> 00:36:45,030
Thanks to Jiang Yubai

800
00:36:45,030 --> 00:36:46,110
for preparing this sumptuous dinner,

801
00:36:46,110 --> 00:36:49,070
and thanks to Duan Qiyan's dad
for contributing two dishes to the table.

802
00:36:49,070 --> 00:36:50,550
It's nothing. You're welcome.

803
00:36:50,550 --> 00:36:51,710
Happy New Year, friends.

804
00:36:51,710 --> 00:36:52,630
-Happy New Year!
-Happy New Year!

805
00:36:52,630 --> 00:36:53,920
Happy New Year!

806
00:36:53,920 --> 00:36:55,380
-Happy New Year!
-Cheers.

807
00:36:58,630 --> 00:36:59,630
Come on, eat up.

808
00:36:59,890 --> 00:37:02,030
The Jin family has produced a top student.

809
00:37:02,030 --> 00:37:03,610
Let's toast to Baihui again.

810
00:37:03,610 --> 00:37:04,550
Come on, cheers!

811
00:37:04,550 --> 00:37:06,080
-Cheers.
-Cheers! Cheers!

812
00:37:06,320 --> 00:37:07,150
Baihui,

813
00:37:07,280 --> 00:37:08,480
you've made us proud.

814
00:37:09,440 --> 00:37:10,570
Thank you, Grandma.

815
00:37:11,400 --> 00:37:12,280
Baihui

816
00:37:12,880 --> 00:37:15,210
inherited her dad's talent for studying.

817
00:37:15,480 --> 00:37:16,810
Jinquan loves to learn.

818
00:37:16,960 --> 00:37:18,920
He had good grades since he was little.

819
00:37:18,920 --> 00:37:20,360
He joined a newspaper
right after graduation

820
00:37:20,360 --> 00:37:22,670
and became a section chief shortly after.

821
00:37:22,670 --> 00:37:23,480
Brother,

822
00:37:23,630 --> 00:37:24,670
don't say that.

823
00:37:25,360 --> 00:37:27,360
Hearing that makes me a bit ashamed.

824
00:37:27,760 --> 00:37:29,000
Up to now,

825
00:37:29,280 --> 00:37:31,010
I'm still just a section chief.

826
00:37:31,840 --> 00:37:33,550
-Why mention that?
-It's understandable.

827
00:37:33,550 --> 00:37:35,210
It's mainly because
he has a scholar's temperament.

828
00:37:35,210 --> 00:37:36,900
He's not the type to fight for things.

829
00:37:36,900 --> 00:37:37,730
Right, Mom?

830
00:37:38,260 --> 00:37:39,460
Of course.

831
00:37:39,460 --> 00:37:41,500
Scheming with those people

832
00:37:41,500 --> 00:37:43,210
is a total waste of my time.

833
00:37:43,530 --> 00:37:44,730
Those people at work

834
00:37:44,730 --> 00:37:46,060
are too short-sighted.

835
00:37:46,500 --> 00:37:47,630
My biggest priority

836
00:37:47,690 --> 00:37:49,130
is education.

837
00:37:49,660 --> 00:37:50,840
On a larger scale,

838
00:37:51,050 --> 00:37:53,360
it's about the prosperity of our family.

839
00:37:54,470 --> 00:37:59,190
[From: Lin Zhixia]

840
00:37:54,980 --> 00:37:55,530
Yes.

841
00:37:55,840 --> 00:37:57,370
Happy New Year, Jin Baihui.

842
00:37:57,590 --> 00:37:59,450
How's your New Year's Eve dinner?

843
00:37:59,590 --> 00:38:01,190
Then we must propose a toast.

844
00:38:01,650 --> 00:38:03,690
Baihui is the top of her grade this year.

845
