He can carry it.

1114
00:49:57,110 --> 00:49:57,800
He's got it.

1115
00:50:07,320 --> 00:50:08,110
Jiang Yubai.

1116
00:50:10,190 --> 00:50:11,190
Stop pretending.

1117
00:50:12,400 --> 00:50:13,800
I know you're not drunk.

1118
00:50:31,710 --> 00:50:32,510
Jiang Yubai.

1119
00:50:34,510 --> 00:50:36,970
Did you gain weight
during the winter break?

1120
00:50:42,360 --> 00:50:43,110
Wake up!

1121
00:50:49,800 --> 00:50:51,660
If you don't wake up, I'm leaving.

1122
00:51:05,190 --> 00:51:06,320
You are so annoying!

1123
00:52:19,230 --> 00:52:21,360
The living room was so small back then,

1124
00:52:21,710 --> 00:52:23,760
but it held everyone's laughter.

1125
00:52:25,380 --> 00:52:28,880
The sweetness of the fermented rice wine
seemed to still linger on our tongues,

1126
00:52:28,880 --> 00:52:32,540
and the colors of the fireworks
were reflected in our tears of joy.

1127
00:52:33,230 --> 00:52:35,000
I remember my friends and I

1128
00:52:35,000 --> 00:52:37,360
listening to the lively TV programs,

1129
00:52:38,000 --> 00:52:39,600
clinking glasses clumsily,

1130
00:52:40,230 --> 00:52:43,420
and feeling the warmth
of the word "reunion."

1131
00:52:45,590 --> 00:52:46,400
It turns out

1132
00:52:47,130 --> 00:52:50,010
when the bonds of blood
aren't warm enough,

1133
00:52:50,880 --> 00:52:54,150
Heaven still allows us
to choose our own family.

1134
00:52:55,920 --> 00:52:57,180
That would be friends.

1135
00:52:59,090 --> 00:53:00,950
We don't share the same last name,

1136
00:53:01,110 --> 00:53:03,510
but we remember each other's preferences.

1137
00:53:03,900 --> 00:53:05,820
We've seen each other at our worst

1138
00:53:06,690 --> 00:53:08,620
and shared our brightest moments.

1139
00:53:12,000 --> 00:53:13,460
The precious New Year mood

1140
00:53:13,760 --> 00:53:15,760
is about guarding simple happiness

1141
00:53:15,760 --> 00:53:17,290
with the family you choose.

1142
00:53:19,190 --> 00:53:20,190
The glass is full.

1143
00:53:20,960 --> 00:53:22,020
The glass is empty.

1144
00:53:22,530 --> 00:53:24,590
I really want to raise my glass again,

1145
00:53:24,730 --> 00:53:26,590
clink it gently against the void,

1146
00:53:28,570 --> 00:53:29,780
and toast once more to

1147
00:53:31,180 --> 00:53:33,170
the winter that made us a family.
